      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-06-04T12:57:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Go to 10! The numbers aren't a max - they're a starting point. You'll go up and down from those values as play goes on, however when the energy granted by a specific card is removed, that card is scrapped, triggering anything that might happen on that card for when it is scrapped, etc.</p>\n<p>(Foote: Did I get that wording right? I'm working on it…  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/blush.png?v=9\" title=\":blush:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":blush:\"> )</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:35:10.475Z",
