    {
      "id": 105538,
      "name": "Foote",
      "username": "Foote",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-06-04T13:07:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"penta\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/6f9a4e/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> penta:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Let's say I have 9 points in attack because the numbers on the bottom left add up to that. But i get a bounty that adds an attack. Do i get an extra one and now have 10 or am i stuck at 9?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Rabit is correct! The 1W you got from the bounty will get added to your ship panel (and remember, all energy from techs stay on the techs. This energy goes right to your panel).</p>\n<p>There is no max to your total energy.</p>",
